Brand icons of the AtarCMS default theme (brands.svg), for the site's social network and messenger links.

Simple Icons 16.34.0 (https://simpleicons.org, npm package simple-icons), CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain
dedication). Each <symbol> holds the <path> of the icon file of the same network in simple-icons@16.34.0/icons/, its
<title> left out:

  facebook   icons/facebook.svg
  instagram  icons/instagram.svg
  ok         icons/odnoklassniki.svg
  pinterest  icons/pinterest.svg
  telegram   icons/telegram.svg (also used for the Telegram channel)
  tiktok     icons/tiktok.svg
  viber      icons/viber.svg
  vk         icons/vk.svg
  waze       icons/waze.svg (the map's "Directions in Waze" link)
  whatsapp   icons/whatsapp.svg
  x          icons/x.svg
  youtube    icons/youtube.svg

Simple Icons has no icon for Rutube, Dzen or LinkedIn (removed at the brand owner's request): those links show the
neutral "globe" symbol, the children of lucide-static@1.49.0/icons/globe.svg (Lucide, ISC License; see icons.LICENSE).

The brand names and logos remain trademarks of their owners; Simple Icons' disclaimer applies
(https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons/blob/develop/DISCLAIMER.md).
